# Keep the build context free of things the build never reads.
#
# node_modules is the one that matters: it is hundreds of megabytes, it is sent
# to the daemon on every build, and the frontend stage runs `npm ci` anyway, so
# a local copy is not just useless but a reproducibility hazard. The frontend
# SOURCES are deliberately not excluded here — stage 1 builds from them.
**/node_modules

# Developer-local state that must never reach an image.
data/
.venv/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
